1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,169
I can't believe classes start next week!

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,030
It went by so fast.

3
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,470
Oh.

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,786
Come on, one last trip to the
beach before summer ends!

5
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:12,540
Crowded places really aren't my thing...

6
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:14,440
What are you talking about?

7
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,839
Summer means going to the beach!

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,080
Wait, really?

9
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,740
What's wrong?

10
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,520
Nothing.

11
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,520
It's nothing.

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,470
It really is Sae!

13
00:00:37,471 --> 00:00:39,319
Wait, it actually is Sae!

14
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,880
Whoa, we haven't seen each other
since middle school graduation!

15
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,809
Oh, long time no see.

16
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,039
You startled me.

17
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:45,900
Whoa, your hair got so long!

18
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,439
I didn't recognize you for a second.

19
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,499
I mean, we only knew you
back when you were 'Sae-kun.'

20
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,310
Totally.

21
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,379
Please, seriously, don't bring that up.

22
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,859
That's my ultimate cringe phase.

23
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:56,249
Aw, but I actually really
liked the old Sae-kun.

24
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:57,250
Yeah, me too.

25
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:02,220
Knock it off, that's creepy.

26
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:03,356
Aw, why? What's wrong with that?

27
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:05,496
- Come on, it's not that big a deal.
- So, how's college going for you two?

28
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:06,520
We're getting by.

29
00:01:06,521 --> 00:01:08,030
Oh, really?

30
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,537
(35th Class, Mine High Girls' Tennis Club) (Mukai
Airi: How's everyone doing? We're having...

31
00:01:15,561 --> 00:01:16,799
a girls' tennis reunion in September! It's a joint one with the upperclassmen this time!)

32
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:18,799
(Hinata: I heard Kumagai
senpai is coming too!)

33
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,240
(Kanon: Good for you, Miwa!
You definitely have to come, lol)

34
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:10,100
"How Do We Relationship?"

35
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:18,970
(Episode 4: I Can't Touch You)
It's so hot, I'm melting...

36
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,370
That was such a surprise earlier.

37
00:02:23,810 --> 00:02:27,480
It's been forever since I ran
into anyone from middle school.

38
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,340
Yeah.

39
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:33,350
Was 'Sae-kun' your old nickname?

40
00:02:34,550 --> 00:02:36,790
Sorry, can we just drop that?

41
00:02:41,420 --> 00:02:42,320
I'm sorry.

42
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:44,090
It really was my ultimate cringe phase!

43
00:02:44,290 --> 00:02:47,010
You have embarrassing memories
you'd rather forget too, right, Miwa?

44
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:51,119
Well, yeah, a few...

45
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:55,140
See? It's common
courtesy not to dig them up.

46
00:02:55,570 --> 00:02:56,570
Case closed!

47
00:03:00,216 --> 00:03:01,210
Hey, by the way...

48
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:06,480
Actually, lately...

49
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:09,280
I think there's a high school
reunion coming up for me, too.

50
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:11,450
I'm on the fence about going.

51
00:03:11,690 --> 00:03:12,490
Huh?

52
00:03:12,491 --> 00:03:14,290
Why? You should go.

53
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:19,030
Someone I used to have a
crush on might be there...

54
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:23,830
Of course, I don't feel that
way about her anymore at all.

55
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,139
Then what's the problem?

56
00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:28,140
Just go.

57
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:30,810
But...

58
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:34,210
What, are you worrying about me?

59
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,756
It's not like anything's
gonna happen, right?

60
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:39,550
Or do you still have lingering
feelings for your ex-crush?

61
00:03:41,350 --> 00:03:42,350
No way! Of course not!

62
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:44,620
Well...

63
00:03:45,490 --> 00:03:47,820
All right, I guess I'll go.

64
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,160
Yeah.

65
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:51,560
Take care.

66
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:01,500
Great rehearsal, everyone!

67
00:04:01,501 --> 00:04:02,640
Great work, everyone!

68
00:04:02,910 --> 00:04:04,746
Wait, did Ryu get his
groove back or something?

69
00:04:04,770 --> 00:04:05,970
You bet!

70
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,880
After summer break
comes the campus festival!

71
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,579
And the festival means a live gig!

72
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,380
And a live gig means...?

73
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,880
Getting popular!

74
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:13,979
We'll be so popular!

75
00:04:13,980 --> 00:04:15,480
I see how it is.

76
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:18,190
Um, guys...

77
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:20,790
About the campus festival...

78
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:28,630
(Lightning Rabbit)
What if we try writing an original song?

79
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:30,840
Huh?

80
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,100
You mean write our own music?!

81
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:37,240
It's a rare chance, so I
thought we could give it a shot.

82
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:40,710
I've never done that before.

83
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,979
What about you, Mikkun?

84
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,350
No, no, no way.

85
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:46,110
Though honestly, I've always
thought it sounded pretty cool.

86
00:04:47,500 --> 00:04:51,990
Does that mean... we write the lyrics, too?

87
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:54,789
Hey, that sounds awesome!

88
00:04:54,790 --> 00:04:56,020
- It really does!
- Right?

89
00:04:56,630 --> 00:05:00,130
Only if everyone's on board, of course.

90
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:10,610
So, what do you think?

91
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:17,680
I'm in!

92
00:05:20,020 --> 00:05:21,880
An original song, huh?

93
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:25,320
Composing the music is one
thing... Writing lyrics is tough, though.

94
00:05:25,650 --> 00:05:27,450
Hey Miwa, are you good
at that kind of thing?

95
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:28,820
Huh?

96
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:30,930
I don't know...

97
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,190
Well, um...

98
00:05:32,191 --> 00:05:34,630
I did always like literature
class back in school.

99
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,900
You have that poetic
vibe. I bet you could do it.

100
00:05:38,036 --> 00:05:39,276
What's that supposed to mean?!

101
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,600
Just kidding!

102
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:54,050
Hey, um...

103
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:55,750
Saeko.

104
00:05:58,950 --> 00:05:59,960
Tonight...

105
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,760
I want to be the one.

106
00:06:04,290 --> 00:06:05,290
Huh?

107
00:06:05,630 --> 00:06:07,130
What... What are you saying?

108
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,280
I mean...

109
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:10,930
Well...

110
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:13,840
I want to hold you.

111
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,370
I want to hold you, Saeko.

112
00:06:17,010 --> 00:06:18,410
I want you to let me hold you.

113
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:20,980
Can't I?

114
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:25,840
No, no, no, no, no!

115
00:06:25,850 --> 00:06:26,780
No way, no way, no way!

116
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:29,450
Absolutely not! Okay,
time for you to go home!

117
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:31,790
You don't have to reject me so harshly!

118
00:06:32,090 --> 00:06:33,900
No means no!

119
00:06:34,490 --> 00:06:35,490
Besides...

120
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,500
Where is this coming from all of a sudden?

121
00:06:38,230 --> 00:06:39,900
It's not sudden at all.

122
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,330
I've always wanted to...

123
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,500
But you never let me touch you.

124
00:06:46,470 --> 00:06:48,470
You always keep your clothes on.

125
00:06:51,710 --> 00:06:53,510
I don't need that...

126
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,310
But...

127
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:58,580
Saeko, you said it yourself before...

128
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:04,790
That you... you have
a sex drive, too, right?

129
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:08,189
It's not about having a sex drive.

130
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:10,140
It's just... I can't do it!

131
00:07:11,166 --> 00:07:13,706
I just can't imagine
letting someone hold me.

132
00:07:13,730 --> 00:07:14,730
Why not?

133
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:23,340
Hearing myself pant creeps me out...

134
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:28,210
And I could never let my guard
down enough to moan like an idiot.

135
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:30,950
What's that supposed to mean?

136
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:34,380
Are you saying I look
like an idiot when we do it?

137
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,419
Wait, no! That's not what I meant!

138
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:37,889
Miwa, you're different!
You're cute, so it works!

139
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:38,450
Right?

140
00:07:38,490 --> 00:07:39,490
Whatever, forget it!

141
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:41,360
Miwa...

142
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:08,380
Miwa...

143
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,720
Why are you okay with being held like that?

144
00:08:13,790 --> 00:08:14,790
Well...

145
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:17,030
I never really thought about it...

146
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:21,500
Someone else is doing whatever
they want with your body, you know?

147
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:23,730
Yeah...

148
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:27,570
Of course it's embarrassing.

149
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:32,110
But you tell me I'm cute...

150
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:37,850
...and you accept all of me.

151
00:08:38,650 --> 00:08:41,420
That's why I can trust you
and give myself over to you.

152
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:01,880
Miwa...!

153
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:06,710
Next time, you can hold me...!

154
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,729
No. The mood is
completely ruined for tonight.

155
00:09:23,730 --> 00:09:24,810
Let's just call it a night.

156
00:09:25,430 --> 00:09:26,430
Sorry...

157
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,299
I'll buy you a treat sometime.

158
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:30,300
Thanks.

159
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:38,870
If you really don't want
to, just tell her straight up.

160
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,540
Like, 'I'm not mentally
ready for that yet.'

161
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:45,010
That feels so unfair to her, though...

162
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:48,720
I don't want our relationship
to stay one-sided forever.

163
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,720
Hey.

164
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:54,120
Just out of curiosity...

165
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:55,960
Why won't you take off your clothes?

166
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:58,559
What do you mean, 'why'?

167
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,729
Come on, doesn't it make you
want to strip down even more?

168
00:10:00,730 --> 00:10:02,019
I know I do!

169
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:03,900
Especially in front of someone I like.

170
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,869
Like, baring it all and laying
your cards on the table?

171
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:07,310
What cards are you even laying down?

172
00:10:08,570 --> 00:10:10,440
Seriously, though...

173
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:12,270
What's the real reason?

174
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,340
Well...

175
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,710
I just feel like...

176
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:21,580
I can't stand the whole situation.

177
00:10:22,150 --> 00:10:24,623
It feels like this hyper-rational version
of me watching from the sidelines thinking,

178
00:10:24,647 --> 00:10:27,120
'Why are you getting turned on? It's gross.'
And that just kills the mood completely.

179
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:30,330
I see.

180
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:32,530
Yeah.

181
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,760
I don't get it at all.

182
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:39,670
Wait, come to think of it...

183
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:42,280
Why do I want to take my
clothes off in the first place?

184
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,040
How should I know?

185
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:46,280
Huh, good point.

186
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,550
Now I feel stupid for overthinking this...

187
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:50,739
What are we even talking about?

188
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:52,150
Seriously.

189
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,250
Ugh...

190
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,350
What's up, Sae-chan?

191
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:02,160
Nothing. I was just
zoning out for a second.

192
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,360
Need help with anything?

193
00:11:04,990 --> 00:11:05,990
No, I'm good.

194
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,870
You've got this face right now...

195
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:13,719
like it's not your first time, but it's the day
you're gearing up to have sex for the first time.

196
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,770
Totally that kind of face.

197
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:15,940
Excuse me?!

198
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,160
What are you talking about?!
That's sexual harassment!

199
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:21,540
Hey, my intuition is usually
spot on, so I had to ask.

200
00:11:25,610 --> 00:11:27,080
All right, Kamedo-san...

201
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:31,120
Can you tell what kind of
person I'm dating right now?

202
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:34,420
Hmm, let me think.

203
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:37,360
Pretty clingy...

204
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:40,700
...high-maintenance and intense...

205
00:11:41,830 --> 00:11:45,030
...and prefers giving love over
receiving it. That kind of... guy.

206
00:11:45,770 --> 00:11:47,340
Wrong!

207
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,739
Dead wrong!

208
00:11:48,740 --> 00:11:51,009
Strange. My gut is usually never off.

209
00:11:51,010 --> 00:11:52,070
Too bad, so sad.

210
00:11:52,110 --> 00:11:53,710
I'm going to wipe tables now.

211
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:57,750
You know, Sae-chan, you're
really good at playing it cool.

212
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:03,850
Like I said, you haven't
gotten a single thing right.

213
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:10,930
Sorry I'm late!

214
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,830
No worries. Thanks for
working so hard today.

215
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:14,900
I'm totally beat!

216
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,400
Look, swings!

217
00:12:17,470 --> 00:12:18,550
Let's go on them for a bit!

218
00:12:35,700 --> 00:12:37,959
Saeko, didn't you just
say you were exhausted?

219
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,920
Swings are fun, come on!

220
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:42,890
Oh, I used to stand on
these when I was a kid.

221
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:48,030
You seem kind of hyper today.

222
00:12:53,170 --> 00:12:54,670
That's rare for you.

223
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:56,640
You didn't put on any nail polish today.

224
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:58,340
Oh.

225
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:00,160
Yeah.

226
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,800
Because...

227
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:03,980
We can do it tonight, right?

228
00:13:04,950 --> 00:13:07,020
I thought it'd be better
to leave them bare.

229
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,780
Oh...

230
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,990
I see...

231
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,460
Hey, Saeko.

232
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,230
This is for you.

233
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:24,500
Huh?

234
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:37,380
It's so cute...

235
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:38,710
Wait a second...

236
00:13:38,910 --> 00:13:40,256
Isn't this a little too cute for me?

237
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,680
You should wear it, Miwa.

238
00:13:43,190 --> 00:13:44,390
Actually...

239
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,220
I got one, too.

240
00:13:50,290 --> 00:13:53,800
Isn't wearing matching
jewelry a bit embarrassing?

241
00:13:57,470 --> 00:13:58,800
If you don't like it...

242
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:01,400
...we don't have to wear
them on the same day.

243
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,740
It's not that I hate it...

244
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:06,740
I just wanted to...

245
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:10,180
...do cute girlfriend
stuff once in a while.

246
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,120
All right, all right.

247
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,220
We should head back soon.

248
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:24,420
Hey, um...

249
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:30,000
Can I make one selfish request?

250
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,800
Hm?

251
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:35,900
Could we go to a love hotel nearby?

252
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:37,910
Why...?

253
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,040
I don't know...

254
00:14:40,860 --> 00:14:43,250
I feel like an unfamiliar
place might be easier.

255
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:46,380
If we're at your place, I
might get stuck in my head.

256
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,880
You don't have to force
yourself if you don't want to...

257
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:50,100
It's not that I don't want to.

258
00:14:50,490 --> 00:14:53,920
And if I can't even do this for you...

259
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:57,120
...what kind of girlfriend
does that make me?

260
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:07,560
Come on, Miwa. Let's go.

261
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,660
How long are you going to stay like that?

262
00:15:32,530 --> 00:15:33,530
Well...

263
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:44,310
Aren't I still the one
taking the lead here...?

264
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:48,080
I'll try my best...

265
00:16:02,490 --> 00:16:03,790
Saeko...

266
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,560
You're so cute.

267
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:25,580
Sorry...

268
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:28,200
I really can't take my
clothes off after all...

269
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:30,990
I understand.

270
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:34,220
Then, can I touch you?

271
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,040
It's okay.

272
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:11,760
I'm sorry.

273
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:12,900
Did I hurt you?

274
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:16,930
No.

275
00:17:17,730 --> 00:17:19,030
It doesn't hurt, but...

276
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:21,940
How do I put this...?

277
00:17:27,340 --> 00:17:29,380
You're just... really bad at this.

278
00:17:37,690 --> 00:17:38,690
Miwa.

279
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,090
My turn.

280
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,290
Wait, but...

281
00:17:42,690 --> 00:17:43,759
Tonight was supposed to be my...

282
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:46,090
You're not ready for that level yet.

283
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,160
What?

284
00:17:49,870 --> 00:17:50,870
Damn it...

285
00:17:58,570 --> 00:18:00,210
I'm pathetic...

286
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:09,360
What am I even guarding against?

287
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,729
Look, Miwa.

288
00:18:22,730 --> 00:18:23,730
Huh?

289
00:18:25,250 --> 00:18:26,250
Well?

290
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,939
Aw, so cute!

291
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,470
I'm going to wear this every day.

292
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:30,540
Really?

293
00:18:30,541 --> 00:18:31,909
Even though you were so against it earlier?

294
00:18:31,910 --> 00:18:33,740
I wasn't against it.

295
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:34,980
Just shy.

296
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:36,180
Aww.

297
00:18:36,210 --> 00:18:37,210
Hey, look!

298
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:40,520
Doesn't this make me look like Miwa's girl?

299
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:42,620
What does that even mean?

300
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:48,360
I'll be waiting for you...

301
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:15,040
(Miwa: Sorry for not replying all
day! I'm coming to the reunion, too!)

302
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:19,790
It'll be fine...

303
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,190
Why, why?

304
00:19:23,230 --> 00:19:24,230
What's going on?

305
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:26,429
Oh, long time no see!

306
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:27,960
Long time no see!

307
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:29,699
Hey, long time no see!

308
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:30,889
Sorry I'm late!

309
00:19:30,890 --> 00:19:32,549
Seriously, Miwa, you took forever!

310
00:19:32,550 --> 00:19:34,199
Sorry, the train was delayed...

311
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,489
Oh, that explains it.

312
00:19:35,490 --> 00:19:36,770
Inuzuka?

313
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,120
- Two!
- Two!

314
00:19:50,850 --> 00:19:52,190
- Three!
- Three!

315
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:56,360
Hey, by the way...

316
00:19:56,890 --> 00:19:58,790
If we're talking about
the boys' tennis team...

317
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:00,100
...who do you like?

318
00:20:03,070 --> 00:20:04,070
Huh?

319
00:20:04,770 --> 00:20:05,949
Um...

320
00:20:05,950 --> 00:20:08,469
I don't really have a crush on anyone...

321
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:09,740
If you had to pick one!

322
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:16,180
Maybe Hachiya senpai?

323
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,280
Oh?

324
00:20:17,350 --> 00:20:19,109
Hachiya senpai is great!

325
00:20:19,180 --> 00:20:20,456
You two would make a cute couple.

326
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,180
You should go talk to him later.

327
00:20:22,850 --> 00:20:23,850
Oh...

328
00:20:24,090 --> 00:20:26,790
No, I didn't mean it like that...

329
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:30,290
Everyone uses the word 'like'...

330
00:20:31,490 --> 00:20:33,970
...so why does it automatically
turn into romantic feelings...

331
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:36,800
...just because the person is a guy?

332
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,800
Getting philosophical all of a sudden, huh?

333
00:20:42,570 --> 00:20:43,970
That kind of pressure...

334
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:46,070
...it scares me a little.

335
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:53,750
Why does romance make you feel like your
life is being controlled by other people?

336
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:01,290
You feel that way because...

337
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:04,089
...it means you, Inuzuka...

338
00:21:04,090 --> 00:21:08,060
...haven't caved to the peer pressure
of playing house with childish romance.

339
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,030
Peer pressure...?

340
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:15,700
You know how it is, right?

341
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:18,840
My parents are really strict.

342
00:21:19,810 --> 00:21:21,239
Someone like me...

343
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:23,750
...I've surrendered to all kinds
of pressure so many times.

344
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:28,250
Honestly, every day feels like hell.

345
00:21:30,470 --> 00:21:31,470
That's why...

346
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:35,090
...out of everyone, you, Inuzuka...

347
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:38,290
...I hope you never give in to that stuff.

348
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:47,140
I've made up my mind.

349
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,440
About what?

350
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:54,810
My life...

351
00:21:55,140 --> 00:21:57,110
...I'm going to decide what makes me happy.

352
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:01,150
No matter what anyone
says, I won't give in.

353
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:03,090
So Shiho senpai...

354
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:04,450
...please don't give in, either.

355
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:08,820
Let's find happiness on our own terms.

356
00:22:16,730 --> 00:22:17,730
The truth is...

357
00:22:18,770 --> 00:22:20,770
I came today specifically
to see you, Inuzuka.

358
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:25,810
What do you mean by that?

359
00:22:27,590 --> 00:22:28,590
What do I mean?

360
00:22:31,290 --> 00:22:36,420
Haven't you been avoiding me all this time?

361
00:22:37,590 --> 00:22:39,790
I thought you hated me.

362
00:22:42,890 --> 00:22:43,890
I'm sorry...

363
00:22:44,530 --> 00:22:46,090
I don't blame you...

364
00:22:49,290 --> 00:22:50,930
Right before graduation...

365
00:22:51,530 --> 00:22:53,770
...I was so overwhelmed
by stuff with my family...

366
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:56,070
...and stressed out over exams...

367
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:59,720
...that I kept missing
the chance to reach out.

368
00:23:00,580 --> 00:23:02,680
I just couldn't bring myself to text you...

369
00:23:07,350 --> 00:23:11,090
I never expected you to
show up at the reunion.

370
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:15,960
Did you not want to see me?

371
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,230
Maybe...

372
00:23:21,370 --> 00:23:23,230
Maybe I didn't want to see you.

373
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:27,100
But I really wanted to see you.

374
00:23:32,170 --> 00:23:33,680
That's so unfair...

375
00:23:45,610 --> 00:23:49,560
(Next Episode Preview) If the two of us work
together, we can write the ultimate love song.

376
00:23:49,670 --> 00:23:51,529
I want us to go back to the way we were.

377
00:23:51,530 --> 00:23:53,900
What do you mean, 'the way we were'?

378
00:23:54,010 --> 00:23:55,010
This is...

379
00:23:55,011 --> 00:23:56,110
Ashida-san.

380
00:23:56,330 --> 00:23:57,700
We're not breaking up.

381
00:23:58,210 --> 00:23:59,210
Never.
